                    <div class="zwinfos">
                        <!-- 文本区域 -->
                        <div class="txtinfos" id="ContentBody" style="margin-top:0;">
                            
                                <!--文章主体-->
<p>　　沪指10月12日下跌0.43%，申万所属行业中，今日上涨的有5个，涨幅居前的行业为<span id="bk_90.BK1283"><a  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/90.BK1283" class="keytip" data-code="90,BK1283">银行</a></span><span id="bkquote_90.BK1283"></span>、<span id="bk_90.BK0486"><a  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/90.BK0486" class="keytip" data-code="90,BK0486">传媒</a></span><span id="bkquote_90.BK0486"></span>，涨幅分别为2.32%、1.47%。跌幅居前的行业为<span id="bk_90.BK1215"><a  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/90.BK1215" class="keytip" data-code="90,BK1215">通信</a></span><span id="bkquote_90.BK1215"></span>、<span id="bk_90.BK1201"><a  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/90.BK1201" class="keytip" data-code="90,BK1201">电子</a></span><span id="bkquote_90.BK1201"></span>，跌幅分别为4.49%、3.20%。<span id="bk_90.BK0478"><a  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/90.BK0478" class="keytip" data-code="90,BK0478">有色金属</a></span><span id="bkquote_90.BK0478"></span>行业位居今日跌幅榜第三。</p><p>　　资金面上看，两市主力资金全天净流出263.38亿元，今日有4个行业主力资金净流入，<span web="1"  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/90.BK0486" class="em_stock_key_common" data-code="90,BK0486">传媒</span>行业主力资金净流入规模居首，该行业今日上涨1.47%，全天净流入资金23.65亿元，其次是<span web="1"  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/90.BK1283" class="em_stock_key_common" data-code="90,BK1283">银行</span>行业，日涨幅为2.32%，净流入资金为8.72亿元。</p><p>　　主力资金净流出的行业有27个，<span web="1"  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/90.BK1201" class="em_stock_key_common" data-code="90,BK1201">电子</span>行业主力资金净流出规模居首，全天净流出资金81.68亿元，其次是<span web="1"  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/90.BK1215" class="em_stock_key_common" data-code="90,BK1215">通信</span>行业，净流出资金为55.69亿元，净流出资金较多的还有<span web="1"  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/90.BK0478" class="em_stock_key_common" data-code="90,BK0478">有色金属</span>、<span id="bk_90.BK0427"><a  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/90.BK0427" class="keytip" data-code="90,BK0427">公用事业</a></span><span id="bkquote_90.BK0427"></span>、国防<span id="bk_90.BK0490"><a  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/90.BK0490" class="keytip" data-code="90,BK0490">军工</a></span><span id="bkquote_90.BK0490"></span>等行业。</p><p>　　<span web="1"  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/90.BK0478" class="em_stock_key_common" data-code="90,BK0478">有色金属</span>行业今日下跌3.14%，全天主力资金净流出32.15亿元，该行业所属的个股共141只，今日上涨的有9只；下跌的有132只。以资金流向数据进行统计，该行业资金净流入的个股有38只，其中，净流入资金超千万元的有9只，净流入资金居首的是<span id="stock_0.000975"><a  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/0.000975" class="keytip" data-code="0,000975">山金国际</a></span><span id="quote_0.000975"></span>，今日净流入资金9583.80万元，紧随其后的是<span id="stock_0.002149"><a  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/0.002149" class="keytip" data-code="0,002149">西部材料</a></span><span id="quote_0.002149"></span>、<span id="stock_0.002203"><a  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/0.002203" class="keytip" data-code="0,002203">海亮股份</a></span><span id="quote_0.002203"></span>，净流入资金分别为6607.22万元、4765.77万元。有色金属行业资金净流出个股中，资金净流出超亿元的有10只，净流出资金居前的有<span id="stock_0.002428"><a  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/0.002428" class="keytip" data-code="0,002428">云南锗业</a></span><span id="quote_0.002428"></span>、<span id="stock_0.000657"><a  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/0.000657" class="keytip" data-code="0,000657">中钨高新</a></span><span id="quote_0.000657"></span>、<span id="Info.116.09696"><a  target="_blank" href="http://quote.eastmoney.com/unify/r/116.09696" class="keytip" data-code="116,09696">天齐锂业</a></span>，净流出资金分别为2.31亿元、1.62亿元、1.58亿元。（数据宝）</p><p>　　有色金属行业资金流入榜</p> <table border="0" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="5" align="center" class="cms_autoformat_table"  ><tr><th >代码</th><th >简称</th><th >今日涨跌幅（%）</th><th >今日换手率（%）</th><th >主力资金流量（万元）</th></tr><tr><td>000975</td><td><span web